Package: vos-melt
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: CD burning frontend for V\OS
 Melt is a graphical frontend that drives cdrecord for audio and data
 disc projects (with a virtual CD list and blinker feedback for supported
 burners).
